  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We can find the necessary function values using the graph.\n\nFrom the graph, we note the following:\n\n- When $x=1,$ we have $y=2.$ So, $f(1)=2.$\n\n- When $x=4,$ we have $y=3.$ So, $f(4)=3.$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(1)+f(4)=2+3=5.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
